---
description: MarketRegular evidence packet rules
globs:
  - "editorial/runs/**/research.yaml"
alwaysApply: false
---

Research packets are evidence documents, not prose drafts.

Every factual claim requires:

- unique claim ID
- proposed fact
- verification status
- confidence
- volatility
- freshness requirement
- source
- access date
- evidence or source summary

Never silently resolve conflicting evidence.

Never infer current vendor attendance from an old listing.